  "body": "Priced from day one—asking $998,000 | CV $1,100,000\r\n\r\nWelcome to your new haven in Silverdale! This modern, freestanding home combines comfort, convenience and style, offering a practical two-level layout on a freehold title.\r\n\r\nAll four bedrooms are upstairs, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite for added privacy. Three additional bedrooms provide flexibility for children, guests or working from home. A family bathroom upstairs and a separate downstairs toilet bring the total to 2.5 bathrooms—ideal for busy family mornings and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area features a modern gourmet kitchen and flows seamlessly onto a sunny deck—perfect for entertaining or relaxing with family. The fully fenced outdoor area offers space to enjoy time with family and pets, while a double garage provides convenient parking and storage.\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n\r\n• Freehold title and freestanding, two-level design\r\n• Four upstairs bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n• Two bathrooms upstairs plus a separate downstairs toilet\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with a modern gourmet kitchen\r\n• Seamless flow onto a sunny deck\r\n• Fully fenced and Low-Maintenance Outdoor Area\r\n• Double garage with internal access\r\n• Balance of the 10-year Master Build Guarantee until December 2027\r\n\r\nLocated in a peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood, this home offers convenient access to local schools, Silverdale’s shopping centre, local amenities and motorway connections.\r\nChildcare is just 100 metres away, with Orewa and Red Beach also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSpace for the family, a convenient location and fantastic value at this asking price— this is an opportunity you won’t want to miss.\r\n\r\nContact Evan today to arrange your viewing.",
